  m_Name: New QR Code Data 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: 220 V Besleme Kablosu
  title: 220 V Besleme Kablosu
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Bu 220 V besleme kablosu, test arac\u0131n\u0131n \u015Febeke elektri\u011Fine
    ba\u011Flanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flayarak sistemin enerji ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131
    kar\u015F\u0131lamak i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r. \xD6zellikle ara\xE7 \xFCzerindeki
    ak\xFClerin \u015Farj edilmesi ve test ekipmanlar\u0131n\u0131n harici enerji
    kayna\u011F\u0131yla \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 amac\u0131yla
    kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Ara\xE7 ak\xFCs\xFCn\xFCn yetersiz kald\u0131\u011F\u0131
    durumlarda, sistemin kesintisiz \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flayarak
    test i\u015Flemlerinin g\xFCvenli ve verimli \u015Fekilde devam etmesine olanak
    tan\u0131r."
